{{!
    @template local_coursegen/preview_scorm_toc

    A previewed SCORM package's table of contents, ported from
    scorm_format_toc_for_treeview(). Nests learning objects with a
    recursive partial (preview_scorm_toc_node), since a package can nest
    them arbitrarily deep.

    Context variables optional for this template:
    * orgtitle - string, the organisation's own title, shown as the first
                 (unlinked) entry.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * nodes - array, each shaped the way preview_scorm_toc_node.mustache
              expects.
}}
<ul>
    {{#orgtitle}}<li>{{{orgtitle}}}</li>{{/orgtitle}}
    {{#nodes}}
    {{> local_coursegen/preview_scorm_toc_node }}
    {{/nodes}}
</ul>
